1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,593
Maya has many tiny jobs.

3
00:00:07,593 --> 00:00:09,348
Wrap this.

4
00:00:09,348 --> 00:00:11,143
Carry that.

5
00:00:11,143 --> 00:00:12,912
Tap this.

6
00:00:12,912 --> 00:00:15,930
One Eddie cannot hold them all.

7
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:18,390
Into Boxy they go!

8
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:20,305
One box.

9
00:00:20,305 --> 00:00:24,507
Many little Eddies pop out and run every job.

10
00:00:24,507 --> 00:00:26,941
That is E C S.

11
00:00:26,941 --> 00:00:30,438
A toy box that runs many Eddies.

12
00:00:30,438 --> 00:00:32,034
Oh no!

13
00:00:32,034 --> 00:00:35,332
One little Eddie inside stops.

14
00:00:35,332 --> 00:00:38,164
That one job goes dark.

15
00:00:38,164 --> 00:00:40,784
Maya's toy freezes.

16
00:00:40,784 --> 00:00:42,912
Boxy sees it.

17
00:00:42,912 --> 00:00:44,281
Pop!

18
00:00:44,281 --> 00:00:47,140
A new little Eddie jumps in.

19
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:49,734
The job lights up again.

20
00:00:49,734 --> 00:00:52,859
The box keeps the jobs running.

21
00:00:52,859 --> 00:00:55,345
Now you know Boxy!

22
00:00:55,345 --> 00:01:00,039
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

